**System Process Logger Specification**

Develop an object-oriented application to capture and archive active system processes locally.

**Technical Requirements**

* **Design:** Implement using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) principles. The use of AI assistance for code generation is strictly prohibited, though reference books and documentation are permitted.

* **Process Retrieval:** Query the operating system to obtain a text-based list of all currently running processes.

**File System Management:**

* Automatically verify the existence of or create a directory named `Logs` inside the system's `Documents` folder.
* Export the process data into a text file named `processes`, incorporating the exact date and time of data capture into the filename.

_Note: This is an ongoing project, will be adding more features over time_

**Sources Used to create this project:**

https://docs.python.org/3/library/subprocess.html

https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/answers/questions/1114754/extract-text-from-command-prompt-window

https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-server/administration/windows-commands/windows-commands